contentText:
Druski is looking to follow in the footsteps of Olivia Rodrigo, Sabrina Carpenter, Harry Styles and more hosts who pulled double duty as the musical guest on Saturday Night Live . There&#8217;s only one problem: The Strokes were already booked as this weekend&#8217;s musical guest.

In new promos for Saturday Night Live , the first-time host &#8212; surrounded by cast member Sarah Sherman and The Strokes &#8212; proudly announces, &#8220;Hi, I&#8217;m Druski, and I&#8217;ll be the host and musical guest on SNL this week!&#8221;

