&#8220;Druski, we already have a musical guest &#8212; The Strokes,&#8221; Sherman replies, to which the band&#8217;s Fabrizio Moretti just waves at the viral comedian and says, &#8220;Hi!&#8221;

&#8220;Can they do this ?&#8221; Druski asks before ripping a totally sick (and obviously pantomimed) electric guitar solo.

&#8220;Wow, that&#8217;s really great!&#8221; Strokes frontman Julian Casablancas tells Druski. &#8220;But yes, yes we can.&#8221;

The promos begin with Druski singing a song and playing air guitar and then asking, &#8220;That&#8217;s you guys, right?&#8221; When Moretti politely shakes his head, &#8220;No,&#8221; Sherman urges the host: &#8220;Just do the promo, Druski!&#8221;

